t":"The near side of the river, hey! The cypress painted silver, hoi! The silver wormwood on the ground, the silver stones lie all around...","nextNodeIds":[721740102,721740103]},{"nodeId":721740102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":329848746,"text":"Excuse me...","nextNodeIds":[721740104]},{"nodeId":721740104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20431,"speakerName":"\"Boatman\"","textMapHash":79063826,"text":"Oho, who have we here? Guests? Here to board the boat, perhaps?","nextNodeIds":[721740105]},{"nodeId":721740105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20431,"speakerName":"\"Boatman\"","textMapHash":2365389274,"text":"Ai yai yai, but let's see, now let's see... Oh, you seem like outsiders. That won't do, no, that won't do...","nextNodeIds":[721740106,721740107]},{"nodeId":721740106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2872716162,"text":"\"That won't do\"?","nextNodeIds":[721740108]},{"nodeId":721740108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20431,"speakerName":"\"Boatman\"","textMapHash":3434049234,"text":"The shining silver skiff sails soft to yonder moon, but it was not prepared for you, oh no! Step not aboard, soil not the decks...","nextNodeIds":[721740109]},{"nodeId":721740109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20431,"speakerName":"\"Boatman\"","textMapHash":587542682,"text":"Ai yai yai... The fog is long scattered, and long scattered is the fog! Yet who has not boarded? The lady of the golden hall shall be angry. Most angry...","nextNodeIds":[721740110]},{"nodeId":721740110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":806476914,"text":"Boat...? Where's the boat?","nextNodeIds":[721740111]},{"nodeId":721740111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20431,"speakerName":"\"Boatman\"","textMapHash":3821898274,"text":"Aha, a-hey... The silver skiff, scion of sun and slope, hey! All must come home, all must return, to the moon-mansion that golden burns...","nextNodeIds":[721740112]},{"nodeId":721740112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20431,"speakerName":"\"Boatman\"","textMapHash":2837632506,"text":"But for shame, for shame! Some children have lost their way, and still they have not boarded! The lady she shall be angry. Oh, most, most angry...","nextNodeIds":[721740113,721740114]},{"nodeId":721740113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3110912330,"text":"Do you need any help?","nextNodeIds":[721740115]},{"nodeId":721740115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":20431,"speakerName":"\"Boatman\"","textMapHash":3079099290,"text":"Come, come, board the boat, the boat it is for boarding! Wander not, be lost no more, for life no longer mourning...","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":721740114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2521497498,"text":"Are you listening to me?","nextNodeIds":[721740115]},{"nodeId":721740107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":3630736298,"text":"What are you talking about?","nextNodeIds":[721740108]},{"nodeId":721740103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":36123546,"text":"Who are you?","nextNodeIds":[721740104]}]},{"talkId":7217402,"talkConfig":{"checkActionAfter":false,"crowdLOD0List":[],"decoratorID":0,"disableTalkReview":false,"dontBlockDaily":false,"enableCameraDisplacement":false,"extraLoadMarkId":[],"finishExec":[{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"},{"param":["","","","",""],"type":"TALK_EXEC_NONE"}],"forceNpcNotDestroy":false,"heroRuleId":0,"ignoreDragonTalkRule":false,"isEnableNoBlackInter":false,"linkBehaviorGrpId":0,"loadType":"TALK_NORMAL_QUEST","lockGameTime":false,"lowPriority":fals